"All the light gods were once mortal humans who revolted against the old gods."
"The revolt took centuries and many failures; civilization rose with the new gods."
"The gods keep their mortal past hidden, lest mortals think they too could become gods."
"Seven gods signed the curse on the old: Emeric, Maranor, Maradoc, Neriad, Sardanal, Nous, Efestar."
"The gods can hear mortal thoughts."
"The light gods are locked in a conflict among themselves, though not a mortal one."
"The remaining light gods back Viviane and have promised her aid."
